sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor user as User
  participant reach as Reach
  participant idx as plugins.json (raw URL)
  participant zip as Release zip
  user->>reach: open Marketplace tab
  reach->>idx: GET registry URL
  idx-->>reach: JSON array of entries
  user->>reach: install entry
  reach->>zip: GET downloadUrl (16 MiB max)
  reach->>reach: hash bytes, compare to sha256
  Note over reach: Missing or mismatched hash blocks the install
  reach->>reach: extract in staging dir, then to plugins/id
